Package: pve-sharedlvmthin
Version: 0.9.0~rc5.2
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: lvm2, perl, python3, openssl, multipath-tools, pve-manager, libpve-storage-perl
Maintainer: SharedLvmThin Community <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Shared LVM Thin storage plugin and health dashboard for Proxmox VE
 Shared block storage backend using one LVM thin pool per VM,
 Proxmox cluster locking and dmeventd-based cluster-safe autogrow.
 Includes read-only HTTPS health dashboard with native Proxmox VE
 authentication and storage path monitoring.
